<title>SRI LANKA: Sampath Bank nine month net up 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Sampath Bank nine month net up 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Sampath Bank Ltd for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	  1,348.70    vs	1,154.28</p>
<p>    Net profit	  193.42    vs	  173.02</p>
<p>    Tax provision     104.15    vs	  116.55</p>
<p>NOTE - Sampath Bank is one of four private banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
